  "description": "Lightweight without compromise\nThe ELyte 140 Works is our lightest ever electric mountain bike (eMTB): at 17.36kg (size M, excluding PowerMore range extender) complete with 55Nm of torque, together with 600W of peak power, it perfectly blends lightweight cross country (XC)/trail bike performance with the capability of full-fat eMTBs to deliver an unparalleled and uncompromised ride, wherever the trail leads you: the singletrack, the all-day epic, the home trail hot laps, the descents and the climbs back out – and with a total combined battery capacity of 650Wh, it has the range to do it all.\n\nHighlights\n– 140mm front + 135mm rear of efficient custom-tuned suspension travel.\n– Uni-directional carbon fibre frame is light and reassuringly strong.\n– Bosch Performance Line SX mid-torque (55Nm), full power (600W) motor.\n– 650Wh of combined battery (400Wh internal + 250Wh PowerMore range extender) so you can ride further.\n– 29er wheels front and rear for balanced handling.\n– 250Wh PowerMore range extender included.\n\nMade for riding – not headlines\nWe've not taken any shortcuts when it comes to assembling the finest trail-proven parts possible for the ELyte 140 Works. Nothing that has been put on that compromises performance just to save a few grammes to grab a headline: SRAM's top-shelf XX SL T-Type AXS 1x12 delivers flawless wireless electronic gearing; Fox Float Factory suspension units deliver the ultimate in suspension performance; SRAM Level Ultimate Stealth four-pot hydraulic disc brakes with 180mm rotors for rich, useable power; full-width 800mm wide RaceFace NEXT R bars for maximum control; a full 175mm drop KS Lev Ci post for real-world trail drop; and more.\n\nELyte 140 Works: lightweight, mid-torque, full power. Zero compromises.",
